cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata.
type: software
title: xiaomi_ai_llm
abstract: >-
  Client for the Xiaomi AI speaker MDZ-25-DA (S12A). Native XiaoAI keeps
  lights, weather and similar commands. Open questions go to a cloud LLM
  called by the speaker, then online EdgeTTS. The model does not run on
  the speaker. Not an official Xiaomi product.
authors:
  - name: open-speaker-llm
repository-code: https://github.com/open-speaker-llm/xiaomi_ai_llm
url: https://open-speaker-llm.github.io/xiaomi_ai_llm/
license: MIT
keywords:
